card.statement:
Let $V$ be an irreducible, torsion free, completely pointed $U_q(\mathfrak{sl}_{2})$-module and $v_\lambda$ a weight vector in $V$. The action of $U_q(\mathfrak{sl}_{2})$ on $V$ can be extended to a $U_q(\mathfrak{gl}_{2})$ action such that the following relations hold:

\begin{equation*}
FE\cdot v_\lambda=[\bar K_{1};1][\bar K_2;0]\cdot v_\lambda.
\end{equation*}
